          "description": "Stage of the Expansion pipeline. Expansion signal: Entered when usage passes an expansion threshold, for example seats used above seats paid. Outreach: Entered when a rep or success manager has contacted the workspace admin. Proposal: Entered when a quote for the added seats, plan or add-on has been sent. Negotiation: Entered when the buyer has asked for changes to price or terms. Expanded: Entered when the extra seats, plan or add-on are live and billed. Declined: Entered when the customer declines the expansion, or has not replied after three follow-ups over 30 days.",
